{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@objc"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"refresh"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"onSuccess"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"@escaping"},{"kind":"text","text":" (["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"]?, "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/ConfigurationState","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@SnowplowTracker@E@SPConfigurationState","text":"ConfigurationState"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The callback called when a configuration (cached or downloaded) is set It passes the list of the namespaces associated","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to the created trackers.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"onSuccess"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The trackers configuration is automatically download from the endpoint indicated in the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RemoteConfiguration"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"previously used to setup the trackers.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The method is asynchronous and you can receive the list of the created trackers in the callbacks once the trackers are created.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The downloaded configuration updates the cached one only if the configuration version is greater than the cached one.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Otherwise the cached one is kept and the callback is not called.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: The EventStore will persist all the events that have been tracked but not yet sent."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Those events are attached to the namespace."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If the tracker is removed or the app relaunched with a different namespace, those events can’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be sent to the collector and they remain in a zombie state inside the EventStore."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To remove all the zombie events you can call an internal method "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"removeUnsentEventsExceptForNamespaces"},{"type":"text","text":" on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SPSQLEventStore"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which will delete all the EventStores instanced with namespaces not listed in the passed list."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/snowplowtracker\/snowplow\/refresh(onsuccess:)"]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Type Method","role":"symbol","title":"refresh(onSuccess:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"refresh"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"onSuccess"},{"kind":"text","text":": (["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"]?, "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@SnowplowTracker@E@SPConfigurationState","text":"ConfigurationState"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"SnowplowTracker"}],"externalID":"c:@M@SnowplowTracker@objc(cs)SPSnowplow(cm)refreshOnSuccess:"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/Snowplow\/refresh(onSuccess:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker","doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/Snowplow"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Reconfigure, create or delete the trackers based on the configuration downloaded remotely."}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://SnowplowTracker/documentation/SnowplowTracker":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/snowplowtracker","role":"collection","abstract":[],"title":"SnowplowTracker","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker"},"doc://SnowplowTracker/documentation/SnowplowTracker/ConfigurationState":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/ConfigurationState","kind":"symbol","title":"ConfigurationState","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConfigurationState","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ConfigurationState","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/snowplowtracker\/configurationstate","abstract":[{"text":"State of retrieved remote configuration that states where the configuration was retrieved from.","type":"text"}]},"doc://SnowplowTracker/documentation/SnowplowTracker/Snowplow":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Snowplow"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Entry point to instance a new Snowplow tracker."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/Snowplow","role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/snowplowtracker\/snowplow","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Snowplow"}],"title":"Snow